  "citation": "Petit J R; Raynaud D; Lorius C; Delaygue G; Jouzel J; Barkov N I; Kotlyakov V M (2000): Historical Isotopic Temperature Record from the Vostok Ice Core. CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/CLI.006",
